### 获取商品接口使用的登录凭证
# @name productLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"admin","password":"12345678"}

###

### 不传参数时使用 page=1、page_size=20
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{productLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 使用分页参数查询
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{productLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 按照名称筛选
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products?page=1&page_size=20&name=Go
Authorization: Bearer {{productLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 使用非法分页参数调试参数校验
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products?page=0&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{productLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Accept: application/json
